# Soviet 3 (SOV03T, Big Apple) won by lane P22 through the step server (ra2/tools/ra2_step.py, ra2/tools/ra2_commander.py):
# the base and two sentry guns, engineers on the three oil derricks, Rhinos massed behind a home defence, the Allied
# barracks, war factory and the defences on the way cleared, an engineer into the battle lab (the beacon), and the beacon
# held with everything round it. Replayed by ra2/tests/ra2_campaign.py (missions 1-2 forced won). Inputs and ticks only;
# no game-event shortcut.
# Re-recorded by lane P67 with the frame clock after BuildingClass::Take_Damage became exact (its run-away test sends
# the refinery's docked miner off while unloading, so the run parts at game frame 35,813): the recording's own commands
# to tick 54,647 (the lab not taken, BadGuy1's new war factory by it), then played on: the war factory and two IFVs
# killed, the four engineers and the flak troopers walked up by 92,96, 108,70, 110,52 and 106,36, an engineer into the
# battle lab at tick 59,500, the psychic beacon held by the Rhinos and flak troopers until its timer ran out.
# SOV03U.MAP: ticks are loop frames from the scenario's first
# frame clock: the game's clock advances 16 ms a loop frame
